WEBVTT

00:09:28.947 --> 00:09:31.964
the wild longing to flee.

00:09:31.964 --> 00:09:34.431
But it is too late.

00:09:34.431 --> 00:09:37.081
The wire is ready.

00:09:37.081 --> 00:09:42.519
Decisively my other foot sets itself onto the cable.

00:09:49.718 --> 00:09:54.213
Faith is what replaces doubt

00:09:54.213 --> 00:09:56.243
in my dictionary.

00:09:56.243 --> 00:09:57.469
So after the walk

00:09:57.469 --> 00:09:59.313
people ask me, "How can you top that?"

00:09:59.313 --> 00:10:01.618
Well I didn't have that problem.